+name: parotid gland ducto-acinar unit
+def: "A salivary gland ducto-acinar unit that is part of the parotid gland, consisting of serous acini together with their contiguous intercalated and striated ductal segments, and associated myoepithelial cells, stromal tissue, and vasculature. This unit produces a watery, protein-rich serous saliva." [PMID:24862590, PMID:30855909]
+subset: added_by_HRA
