+def: "A salivary gland ducto-acinar unit that is part of the submandibular gland, consisting predominantly of serous acini with a minority of mucous acini, together with their contiguous ductal segments, and associated myoepithelial cells, stromal tissue, and vasculature. This unit produces a mixed serous-mucous saliva." [PMID:24862590, PMID:30855909]
